{
  "rc": {
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#FBFBFE\\,#F5F5FC)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#181A1F\\,#1D1F28)@90"
      },
      {
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "{hd.y}+({hd.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "bgColor": "#5B5BD6|#A5A3FF",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "_note": "源色点(card-design-system §2):5pt 圆点 / 卡名左侧 / 间距 9pt / 每张卡恰好一次。本包的源色 = 进度格用的那支靛 —— 它已经是这个包在盘上的样子,不另起一个。"
      },
      {
        "id": "hd",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "23.0pt",
        "y": "12pt",
        "w": "200pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "${y}",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
      },
      {
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "15pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-28pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "alignmentH": "2",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "${today}",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "_note": "时效锚(§3):右上角 / 9pt / 次级 / 右对齐 / MM-DD。"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${yPct},--),--),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "pct",
            "type": "richText",
            "x": "14.0pt",
            "y": "36pt",
            "w": "180pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "spans": [
              {
                "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${yPct},--)]",
                "fontSize": "40pt",
                "typeface": "System-Bold",
                "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
              },
              {
                "text": "%",
                "fontSize": "18pt",
                "typeface": "System-Bold",
                "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${yPct},--),--),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "pctE",
            "type": "richText",
            "x": "14.0pt",
            "y": "48pt",
            "w": "180pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "spans": [
              {
                "text": "--",
                "fontSize": "40pt",
                "typeface": "System-Bold",
                "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
              },
              {
                "text": "%",
                "fontSize": "18pt",
                "typeface": "System-Bold",
                "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "dayN",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "44pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-28pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "alignmentH": "2",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${yDay},--)]$[if::(eq::(${yDay},1),${@i18n.dayUnit1},${@i18n.dayUnit})]",
        "_note": "⚠️ 不做「第 N 天」这种**前缀 + 数 + 后缀**的三段拼 —— 英文那档的前缀是 `Day `、后缀是空,而空串译文在 i18n 契约里是「刻意为空」不是「没翻」(lint 会 W 提醒),为一句话背一个语义歧义不值。改成「数 + 单位」两段,两种语言都有实词。",
        "fontSize": "12pt",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
      },
      {
        "id": "leftN",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "63pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-28pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "alignmentH": "2",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "${@i18n.left} $[findNotEmpty::(${yLeft},--)]$[if::(eq::(${yLeft},1),${@i18n.day1},${@i18n.day})]",
        "fontSize": "11pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
      },
      {
        "id": "per",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "82pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-28pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "alignmentH": "2",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "${@i18n.perWeek}",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "_note": "图例挂在**格子上方右侧**,不与下面那排 Q 标签同行 —— 同行那一版在 en 下「1 cell = 1 week」直接压到 Q4 上(zh 的四个字恰好不撞,只看中文过不了这一关)。"
      },
